        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Yeah, which is why it&#39;s cool if Ab&#39;Zero (versus Plague Rat) has been Infected and Visionary has played Twist on him and he has his NPCU out - free hesling at the start of every turn! :D Made even better, of course, if he has his Focused Apertures out. I think the Cryo Chamber works there too, since I recall it adds to his cold damage [i]received[/i]. Actually it doesn&#39;t matter if it adds to his cold damage [i]dealt[/i], since he&#39;s hitting himself anyway ;). Anyway, that was a really fun game and the only reason Ab&#39;Zero wasn&#39;t on full health at the end of it was &#39;cause he hit himself with some fire damage on his final turn in order to finish off Rat with the resultant cold damage :D.\n",
